        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Salt Spring\\'s Weavers and Spinners Guild returns to ArtSpring for its annual fall exhibition and sale from October 23-26. We cordially invite you to drop by to browse for one-of-a-kind gifts or to chat with guild members about their textile passions. This is a dynamic group of textile artisans who handcraft both practical and decorative [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
